  "learningGoal": "Read the center and radius from (x-h)² + (y-k)² = r².",
  "spokenLines": [
    "Every circle has an equation.",
    "In standard form: x minus h, squared, plus y minus k, squared, equals r squared.",
    "The center is h comma k. The radius is r.",
    "Take x minus two, squared, plus y plus three, squared, equals sixteen.",
    "Center: two, negative three. Watch the signs — plus three means minus negative three.",
    "Radius: the square root of sixteen, which is four.",
    "Draw the axes and the circle.",
    "That's it — read the numbers straight off."
  ],
